        <mxCell id="LEG_STEPS" value="&lt;b&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt; Cidad&#227;o acessa o Angular SPA por HTTPS.&#xa;&lt;b&gt;2.&lt;/b&gt; Wizard captura dados; UF/munic&#237;pios v&#234;m do IBGE (fallback local JSON).&#xa;&lt;b&gt;3.&lt;/b&gt; SPA envia POST multipart /api/denuncias ao BFF.&#xa;&lt;b&gt;4.&lt;/b&gt; BFF aplica seguran&#231;a (Helmet/CORS/Rate limit + Multer 20MB/10 arq.).&#xa;&lt;b&gt;5.&lt;/b&gt; Controller orquestra: valida&#231;&#227;o &#8594; ClamAV INSTREAM &#8594; MPT API (Bearer).&#xa;&lt;b&gt;6.&lt;/b&gt; Retorno 201+protocolo (ou erro expl&#237;cito) e limpeza no finally." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#FBFCFD;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#17324D;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2485" y="745" width="360" height="180" as="geometry" />
